      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Modern animation continues drawing from Yellow Submarine's wellspring. The Beatles: Get Back - The Rooftop Concert (2022) paid homage to the film's style in its promotional materials, while films like <a href=\"/movie/137106\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"137106\">The LEGO Movie</a> (2014) and <a href=\"/movie/324857\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"324857\">Spider-Man: Into the Spider-Verse</a> (2018) echo its fearless visual experimentation. The film's message about the power of music and creativity to overcome negativity resonates in works like <a href=\"/movie/354912\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"354912\">Coco</a> (2017) and <a href=\"/movie/508442\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"508442\">Soul</a> (2020), proving its thematic relevance endures."
      }
